OL,4,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,5,     FShow
OL,6,     GIt's been another big year for
OL,7,     Gfunk and soul, and Craig Charles
OL,8,     Gis wrapping it up in style with
OL,9,     G'The Finest Funk & Soul Tunes of
OL,10,     G2025'.
OL,11,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,12,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,13,     Gcross time, space and genre. This
OL,14,     Gweek, he's got new tunes by the
OL,15,     Glikes of Dub Pistols, Soma Soma,
OL,16,     GJasper Tyner and Origin One.
OL,17,G2300FSHERELLE
OL,18,     GThe second of two Saturday night
OL,19,     Gshows rounding up SHERELLE's
OL,20,     Gfavourite 2025 tracks! Featuring
OL,21,     Gmusic from Introspekt, Erika de
OL,22,     GCasier, aya and Nia Archives.
